---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import QuoteBanner from '../components/QuoteBanner.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import '../styles/about.css';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Me">
  <div class="about-page page-shell">
    <main id="main-content">
      <section>
        <div class="wide-container emily-section">
          <div>
            <img src="/images/emily-photo.jpg" alt="Emily with turquoise earrings" class="emily-photo" />
          </div>
          <div class="emily-content">
            <h1>Hi, I'm Emily.</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">psychologist, healer, guide</p>
            <p>
              In the Fall of 2024, I had finally "done it". I'd completed the checklist:
              fancy degree<span class="checklist-item">✓</span>
              partner<span class="checklist-item">✓</span>
              house<span class="checklist-item">✓</span>
              career plan<span class="checklist-item">✓</span>. Then it hit me...
            </p>
            <p class="highlight"><strong>I'm not happy.</strong></p>
            <p><em>That's when my real work started.</em></p>
            <p>
              I'm probably not your average clinical psychologist. I don't believe all the books.
              I probably won't use the manual. I genuinely believe that, in your heart of hearts,
              <em>you already know what you need to know.</em>
            </p>
            <p>
              I can't give you the answers, but I have walked the path. Over the past year, I have
              come home to myself. <strong>If you feel guided to do the same, walk with me. I'd love
              to walk you home.</strong>
            </p>
            <p class="ready-text">Ready to drop the masks?</p>
            <a href={site.calendlyUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="cta-button">SCHEDULE A CONSULT</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="about-copy">
          <h2>Training &amp; Professional Experience</h2>
          <div class="section-rule"></div>
          <p><em>I'm more than the letters after my name &mdash; and so are you.</em></p>
          <p>
            Credentials are not the whole story, and they should never ask you to override your
            own inner knowing. But I do believe training matters, because healing work asks for
            real skill, discernment, and care.
          </p>
          <p>
            I studied psychology at UC Berkeley, worked in neuropsychological assessment at UCSF,
            and earned my doctorate at the PGSP-Stanford PsyD Consortium, affiliated with Stanford
            University School of Medicine.
          </p>
          <p>
            I spent years training in and practicing evidence-based therapy, including ACT, EFT,
            CPT, CBT, DBT, EMDR, mindfulness-based approaches, and trauma-focused care. I have led
            mindfulness groups at Stanford, created and led psychoeducational groups for couples,
            and received specialty training in LGBTQ+ care, trauma/PTSD, and relationship distress.
            Across individual, couples, and group work, I have supported more than 300 people in
            their healing and recovery.
          </p>
          <p>
            I mention this because, while my work has evolved, this is my background.
            <strong>I know the manuals. I just also know from the inside what feels truer to me.</strong>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="about-copy">
          <h2>Where My Work Lives Now</h2>
          <div class="section-rule"></div>
          <p>These days, my work lives at the intersection of <strong>psychology &amp; soul.</strong></p>
          <p>
            I draw most directly from Internal Family Systems, somatic healing, and Transformational
            NLP, infused with my own intuition and energetics.
          </p>
          <p>What these approaches share is a belief I hold deeply: <strong>you are not broken.</strong></p>
          <p>
            Your deeper Self &mdash; your soul, essence, and inner knowing &mdash; remains whole and intact
            beneath the trauma, conditioning, and survival strategies you've carried. My work is
            about helping you reconnect with that wholeness, heal the young parts of you that got
            stuck in the past, release what is no longer yours, and
            <em>reclaim your power as the conscious co-creator of your life.</em>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="education-content">
          <h2>Education</h2>
          <div class="section-rule"></div>
          <div class="education-subsection">
            <h3>Academic Credentials</h3>
            <div class="credential"><strong>Bachelor of Arts in Psychology (BA)</strong> &mdash; University of California, Berkeley</div>
            <div class="credential"><strong>Doctor of Clinical Psychology (PsyD)</strong> &mdash; PGSP-Stanford PsyD Consortium</div>
          </div>
          <div class="education-subsection">
            <h3>Alternative Healing Credentials</h3>
            <div class="credential"><strong>Master Level Transformational NLP Practitioner</strong> &mdash; NLP Marin</div>
            <div class="credential"><strong>Advanced Somatic Healer</strong> &mdash; Alchemy Somatics</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="beliefs-content">
          <h2>Some Things I Believe That Inform My Work</h2>
          <div class="section-rule"></div>
          <div class="belief-item">The universe is always <strong>conspiring for your highest good</strong></div>
          <div class="belief-item">Most things worth knowing are a <strong>paradox</strong></div>
          <div class="belief-item">What life presents to us is ultimately <em>for us</em></div>
          <div class="belief-item">Life flows better when we <strong>surrender</strong> <span class="note">(note: this does not mean being passive)</span></div>
          <div class="belief-item">We are <strong>co-creators</strong> with the divine</div>
          <div class="belief-item">Our reality is a <strong>hologram</strong> of our internal world: as above, so below</div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>
  <QuoteBanner quote={`"Courage is not the absence of fear. Courage is fear walking."`} author="— Susan David, PhD" />
</BaseLayout>
